<p>Each time you consume a mark, you gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 7%, 10%, 11%, 13%</acronym> increased attack speed for 2 turns and the cooldown of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0, 1, 2, 2, 3</acronym> random techniques are reduced by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> turns.</p>